-- Publish local script to online featured short dramas (ai_featured_works).
-- Project: proj-dd6ca6baac23473b; episodes/shots/videos/previews: 3/73/73/3.
-- EP3 trimmed to 17 beats (removed duplicated shots 2 and 4), headings re-timed.
-- Payload is Base64 (ASCII only) so any Navicat encoding works. No canvas: process view is synthesized from shots.
-- Idempotent upsert by project_id.

